{"type":"npc","name":"Nebulite","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":300,"temp":0,"max":300,"details":""},"ac":{"value":33,"details":"all-around vision"},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":null,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":35}],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"cold","exceptions":[]},{"type":"force","exceptions":[]},{"type":"light","exceptions":[]},{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]},{"type":"sleep","exceptions":[]},{"type":"inhaled","exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":[],"details":"Planetary polyglot, Telepathy 10 miles"},"level":{"value":14},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>The violent supernova death of a star and all nearby life dependent upon it is a loss that defies comprehension. Yet not all of the star's essence is lost, for whoever was the last to bask in the dying star's warmth becomes an unwitting mourner. On rare occasions, a seed from the star's core, enveloped in the thoughts and dreams of all those who perished in the cataclysm, collapses into a composite consciousness known as a nebulite. The nebulite then has one goal: to nestle itself into a nebula, where it can slowly gather stardust until it can be reborn as a star once more, bringing light and life to a dark corner of the universe. Getting in its way during this pilgrimage, however, can prove exceedingly dangerous.</p><h2>Communication</h2><p>A nebulite's voice is a near-overwhelming harmony of the voices of all the sentient beings consumed in the supernova, and its thoughts are often just as diverse and scattered.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 560/1,250/2,300 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> armor (heavy), perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Lore [Planetary], Occultism)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> body, bane, elongating, energy resistant (cold, force, vitality), force, intelligence, light, mind, mind shield, sensory (darkvision, greater darkvision), space, space shield, spells (Occult: @UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.sf2e-spells.zHIyTSrtCp8F2Vfp]{Black Hole}), strength, throwing, time, wild, winged, wisdom</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Kalen Herrmann-Mowling","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":8},"dex":{"mod":5},"con":{"mod":4},"int":{"mod":8},"wis":{"mod":7},"cha":{"mod":4}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":28,"senses":[{"type":"greater-darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":24,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":25,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":28,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":27},"athletics":{"base":28},"occultism":{"base":30}},"traits":{"value":["astral"],"rarity":"rare","size":{"value":"grg"}}},"_id":"xzSxuGST2tbAfFs2","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/nebulite.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Nebulite","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":4,"height":4,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/nebulite.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":[],